---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service – Publication Guidelines"
  description={`Terms and conditions governing the access and use of ${siteConfig.name}'s horology publications and academic content.`}
  path="/terms/"
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Publication Guidelines</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>

    <p>
      Last updated: November 2026. By accessing and reading {siteConfig.name} (the "Publication"), you agree
      to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Intellectual Property & Citation Rights</h2>
    <p>
      All original editorial articles, research papers, diagrams, mathematical formulas, and historical analyses published on {siteConfig.name} are the intellectual property of the Clock Garden Research Collective unless otherwise indicated.
    </p>
    <p>
      Academic citation and brief excerpts for educational, review, or research purposes are permitted, provided clear attribution is given with a direct clickable link to the source article on {siteConfig.name}. Bulk scraping, automated reproduction, or republishing full articles without explicit written permission is strictly prohibited.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Informational & Scholarly Purpose</h2>
    <p>
      The technical and historical analyses on this site are published for educational, historical, and scientific purposes. While our researchers strive for meticulous accuracy and cross-verify with recognized horological standards (e.g., BIPM, COSC, METAS, ISO), timekeeping specifications are subject to manufacturer revisions and historical debate.
    </p>

    <h2>3. External Links & Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Our articles may link to external primary sources, museum archives, and academic institutions. We are not responsible for the content, privacy policies, or availability of external third-party sites.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Amendments</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to revise these Terms of Service at any time. Changes become effective immediately upon posting to this page.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Inquiries</h2>
    <p>
      For syndication requests, rights clearance, or questions regarding these Terms, please contact us at:
      <a href="mailto:editorial@clockgarden.com">editorial@clockgarden.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
